Package: USGSm2m
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to the USGS/EROS Machine-to-Machine (M2M) Application Programming Interface (API)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Steven", "Pawley",
      email = "dr.stevenpawley@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: The USGS/EROS Machine-to-Machine (M2M) Application Programming 
  Interface (API) provides a method of searching and acquiring data from the 
  USGS/EROS data inventories. The M2M API provides the same options and 
  functions as EarthExplorer (EE) including searching for data collections and
  imagery, requesting metadata, and accessing all datasets in the EE catalog.
  Note that this package is not affiliated with the USGS/EROS, but is a 
  community-developed interface to the M2M API for use in R.
